# Butler Routes - Hillsbrad recipes and patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans, schematics and formulas whose SOURCE is
# physically in Hillsbrad Foothills, verified against the local Forever game
# data (questie-forever item vendor and drop tables). Twenty-five recipes are
# vendor-sold; four more drop exclusively from Hillsbrad mobs (two of those
# droppers outlevel the zone, so those steps say to come back later). Every
# other Hillsbrad-dropping recipe is a generic multi-zone world drop, and quest
# records carry no reward data (see docs/companion-unverified.md).
# Trainer-taught staples are excluded: Polestar's own profession guides cover
# those. Each step is gated to its profession; other characters skip it
# cleanly. First Aid and Fishing have no Hillsbrad source, so they are stated,
# not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/hillsbrad-recipes
title Hillsbrad Foothills - Recipes & Patterns
levels 20-32
zone Hillsbrad Foothills
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords hillsbrad, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

