  note Dropped only by the Crushridge Warmonger (level 39) at the far-north Alterac edge, well above the zone band: come back at high level rather than fighting it at zone level. The schematic drops nowhere else in the data.

step First Aid and Fishing — no Hillsbrad source

  note The data holds no First Aid or Fishing recipe sourced in Hillsbrad Foothills: no in-zone vendor sells one and no in-zone mob drops one. Polestar's own profession guides cover those professions' progression.
